command:importance

** Generate a database object importance report

table-filter
Regular expression for table and view full names to include in the report

max-important-tables
Maximum number of important tables to include in the report (default 5, <=0 for all)

max-communities
Maximum number of communities to include in the report (default 5, <=0 for all)

max-community-size
Maximum members per community to include in the report (default 5, <=0 for all)

output-format
Supported importance report output formats
<output-format> is one of ${COMPLETION-CANDIDATES}
Optional, inferred from the extension of the output file

Add command options to the `execute` command in the SchemaCrawler Shell
